  <item>
    <title>人生百业018|澳新打工度假7年：关于WHV你想知道的一切</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69c928c4e2c8be3155cff975</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c928c4e2c8be3155cff975</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔9个月的播客更新～</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎嘉宾@小内！因为特殊原因（疫情），她在新西兰+澳大利亚打工度假了将近7年，期间体验了农场类、旅游服务类、矿区类等多份工作，也充分体验了澳洲的自然风光和风土人情。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs2AKLUn71c-PnliJm3-hVvIjupy.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目，你不仅可以听到以下信息：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>丰富多彩的各类工作体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>WHV真实收入情况</span></p><span></span><p><span>澳洲的社会保障体系</span></p><span></span><p><span>外国人很难进入的神秘矿区</span></p><span></span><p><span>澳洲的疫情政策</span></p><span></span><p><span>打工度假前的规划和准备工作</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>还能充分感受到小内“想做就做”的超强执行力和“先做做看”的试错心态；</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>希望本期节目能对你有帮助！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">00:01:20</a> 相亲节目爆火后，全国人民都在和我抢WHV…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">00:08:39</a> 第一份工作：摘蓝莓，吃饱了再说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">00:16:37</a> 打工度假可以实现收支平衡吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">00:17:14</a> 挖土豆和种花椰菜使我进入心流状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">00:22:10</a> 给喜欢的薯片厂写信求工作，老板直接面试发offer！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">00:27:54</a> 澳洲咖啡店，主打一个松弛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">00:33:11</a> 雪山工作期间的暖心小故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">00:36:20</a> 澳洲的养老金和社会保障体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">00:38:44</a> 澳洲看病记之谁是医生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2469">00:41:09</a> 外国人鲜少涉足的神秘矿区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">00:46:03</a> 澳洲“矿工”都吃点啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3053">00:50:53</a> 照顾宠物换宿，一年没有租房！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3288">00:54:48</a> 矿区工作利与弊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3414">00:56:54</a> 澳洲的疫情防护政策很p人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3585">00:59:45</a> 工作选择：农村vs城市，买车or不买车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3757">01:02:37</a> 人、天气、硕大蟑螂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3989">01:06:29</a> 会打架的袋鼠是什么口感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4106">01:08:26</a> WHV前的能力准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4489">01:14:49</a> WHV前的资金准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4556">01:15:56</a> 猜嘉宾MBTI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4651">01:17:31</a> 如何开始第一份工作</span></p>]]></description>
