  <item>
    <title>人生百业017|成为剧本杀店老板、打造情感本的爱恨世界是一种怎样的体验？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a95467293471fed40b7765</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a95467293471fed40b7765</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎本期嘉宾小林老师～</span></p><span></span><p><span>她和两位朋友一起创业，在一线城市开了一家剧本杀店，主攻演绎情感本，开业仅半年就跻身本地Top5！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>经营一家剧本杀店是怎样的体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span>小娱乐圈一般的情感剧本杀圈子，有着怎样的生态和潜规则？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如梦似幻的情感本演绎，藏着幕后人员怎样的辛酸？</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a>创业开店的情况简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">03:31</a>什么是情感本？它的魅力在哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a>i人也会享受飙戏吗？遇到爱笑场的玩家怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a>三个合伙人如何分工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a>作为剧本杀店合伙人之一的一天24h都如何度过？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a>类似追星：原来剧本杀dm/npc也会有忠实粉丝呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a>每一场情绪价值满满的情感剧本杀，背后是呕心沥血为爱发电的老板和dm</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a>老板难当——本行业有特殊的人员管理风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a>靠当诚心商家和良心上司获得圈内好口碑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a>保护被玩家骚扰的女性npc</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a>创业的挣扎与彷徨、成就感与信念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1855">30:55</a>不要爱上男dm，会变得不幸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a>有什么是当玩家时不懂，自己开店后才懂的内幕？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2583">43:03</a>盒装推理本vs情感本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">45:52</a>如果想给剧本杀店提供剧本应该走什么途径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2915">48:35</a>避坑指南：教你选靠谱的店和本子</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/607125c66d88ba100d0bf6e2/lvtp9dzqdqGHEMN5aUOXAxbvPpFa.m4a" length="51146269" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjJ2qLzY8YDVXPuiBv8xjZeY5V7u.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>聊聊结婚生子：成为妻子和母亲后的自我成长之旅</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a6d4f042cc2798e7b0cd4a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a6d4f042cc2798e7b0cd4a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Aug 2025 08:15:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“结婚生子”，在今天，至少在互联网的语境中，似乎已经成为了一个可疑的事情，它常常意味着妥协、牺牲、甚至失去自我，对于女性来说更是如此。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾@叮叮 让我们看到了结婚生子的另一种可能性。叮叮是一位产品经理，和大学期间相识的爱人结婚，目前有一个5岁的孩子，在工作和养娃之外，还有着非常丰富的个人生活。这段婚姻给她带来了全新的人生体验，而她也在这段关系里保持、甚至生长出了更好的自我。希望这期节目能够提供一个关于婚姻的不一样的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>特别鸣谢本期剪辑@橘子掰八瓣 在主播小猪生病期间给予的援助~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">00:01:31</a> 嘉宾的工作和婚姻概况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="353">00:05:53</a> 大脑的构造决定了养娃和工作其实可以互为休息时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">00:09:05</a> 养娃的前期辛苦和后期受益</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">00:12:29</a> 干货！如何挑选适合一起养娃的伴侣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">00:20:51</a> 无师自通的婚姻观如何养成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1646">00:27:26</a> 恋爱以来最大矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">00:30:29</a> 亲密关系中，了解自己的需求很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1976">00:32:56</a> 为什么我们会在亲密关系中"变成另一个人"？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">00:36:16</a> 如何开始寻找合适的恋爱对象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">00:42:27</a> 决定结婚生娃的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">00:44:17</a> 成为母亲后，我的时间更多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2886">00:48:06</a> 育儿改善了我的情绪管理能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2976">00:49:36</a> 育儿如何成为我学习的最强动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3186">00:53:06</a> 养娃的责任感让我变成更好的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3353">00:55:53</a> 成为母亲后的时间管理心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a> 如何控制手机使用时间和利用碎片时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4070">01:07:50</a> 成为母亲后我才真正爱上了学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4205">01:10:05</a> 为人父母如何面对社会鸡娃的焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4549">01:15:49</a> 如何在孩子面前处理和伴侣的矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4749">01:19:09</a> 关于婚姻和生育的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5236">01:27:16</a> 聊聊女性生育损伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5427">01:30:27</a> 爱自己是最好的言传身教</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5479">01:31:19</a> 猜猜嘉宾的MBTI</span></p>]]></description>
