  <item>
    <title>莫斯科旅行真实体验：浓墨重彩俄国游</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68478e0c79e285b9b81d3f11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68478e0c79e285b9b81d3f11</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎本期嘉宾@一锅～</span></p><span></span><p><span>一锅老师几人在五一假期勇闯毛子国，留下了对俄罗斯莫斯科的鲜明记忆，有好有坏，有感动有无语，有收获有遗憾……</span></p><span></span><p><span>也给本期播客留下了精彩的段子和故事！</span></p><span></span><p><span>莫斯科旅游体验如何？有哪些值得推荐的景点活动？有需要避雷的吗？俄罗斯美食好吃吗？……答案都在播客里啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> 五一外国游，人多吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 武装力量大教堂，极繁美与细致展览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a>不懂俄语怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 翻译软件翻了什么让人不安的东西啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 可爱热情的俄罗斯小女孩们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 话唠的毛子司机大叔太可怕了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 路遇神秘面瘫NPC大哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1088">18:08</a> 被小红书种草的“地铁巡礼”打卡拍照实际如何？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 一个人去俄罗斯旅游适合吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 草台班子服务业：关于打车和购物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 在米其林餐厅的捉急体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 那里帅哥美女真的很多吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2029">33:49</a>俄罗斯人你们平时就吃这些是吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 莫斯科旅游性价比如何，一个人花了多少钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 强强强烈安利某芭蕾舞剧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">41:07</a> 优雅是一辈子的事～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2587">43:07</a> 走丢的外卖、无辜的顾客和不讲理的客服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2718">45:18</a> 对莫斯科的博物馆有点失望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a> 传统彩蛋：猜嘉宾MBTI</span></p>]]></description>
