  <item>
    <title>城市系列001|上海之于外地年轻人的工作居住体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6834257938dcc57c6401b886</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6834257938dcc57c6401b886</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 May 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎本期嘉宾@花花！</span></p><span></span><p><span>花花是一位在上海实习和工作n年的年轻外地女性，从个人体验出发，我们一起聊一聊她眼里的上海生活～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:00:22</a>嘉宾背景和工作居住地简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">00:02:37</a>浅聊上海各区特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="451">00:07:31</a>“上海生活可比北京好多了”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">00:10:13</a>在上海挤地铁的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">00:11:35</a>在上海遇到过地域歧视吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">00:13:34</a>上海的职场更公平吗？搞人际关系重要吗？卷吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">00:22:07</a>在上海拿到多少薪资就可以好好生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">00:26:05</a>周末的公园里长满了来找松弛感的社畜啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1659">00:27:39</a>上海根本没有小众景点！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1796">00:29:56</a>上海美食？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">00:32:29</a>上海就医体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2046">00:34:06</a>上海的交通体系如何</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">00:36:17</a>上海的窗口办事儿效率真不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">00:38:21</a>上海存在的一些现实问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2422">00:40:22</a>把上海强烈推荐给单身独立女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2451">00:40:51</a>传统彩蛋：猜猜嘉宾的MBTI</span></p>]]></description>
